# data/transactions.csv, models/fraud_detector.joblib, and reports/ are
# committed on purpose: they're the demo's checked-in trained model and
# held-out evaluation artifacts, regenerable at any time with
# `python -m src.train` (see README Quick start), so judges and deployment
# get a working app without a multi-minute training run first.
